# Supabase And RLS Operations

- Use port 6543 for Supabase connections. Never assume 5432 in this repo.
- Keep migration filenames unique and sequential. Do not create conflicting numeric prefixes.
- Default Supabase migrations are transactional. Do not use CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY inside them.
- Every new tenant-scoped table must ship with RLS enabled, tenant_id indexing, and all required policies.
- Add or update pgTAP coverage for security-sensitive schema changes and RLS behavior.
- Regenerate generated database types after schema changes. Do not hand-maintain drift-prone types.
